  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\">ALL LUCKY BLOCK</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>英文介绍</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>通过《All Lucky Block》将运气与混乱提升到全新境界！本整合包汇集了海量幸运方块，每个方块都拥有独特的奖励、陷阱和不可预测的事件。探索全新的幸运方块，迎接意想不到的挑战，每次游玩都能体验截然不同的冒险。你永远不知道下一个被破坏的方块里会藏着什么！🍀</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙语</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>通过《All Lucky Block》将运气与混乱提升到全新境界！本整合包汇集了海量幸运方块，每个方块都拥有独特的奖励、陷阱和完全不可预测的事件。发现新的幸运方块，面对意想不到的挑战，享受每局独一无二的体验。打破下一个方块时，你永远不知道里面会有什么！🎲</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>由 @d_de_diego_d 制作</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持作者 ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fddediegood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_68549b52-a129-4666-80cb-67f09f5db302.png\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\" width=\"205\" height=\"70\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/